# An attachment URL is a capability: anyone who quotes it in a comment they can
# see gets a signed link to the bytes (docs/decisions/022). A journal committed
# to a PUBLIC repository therefore publishes every asset it lists. This
# repository is public, so its own journal stays out of it.
